      "content": "exactly. it's not just a bad mood or a slump. it's like if you look at the data of my entire life, the trend line is just a straight descent. you can't fight the second law of thermodynamics. you can't build order out of chaos forever. i look at my life and i don't see a person anymore, i just see a system that has reached its peak and is now purely in a state of decay. it's mathematically impossible to reverse that. everything is just... winding down to zero.",
